## Writing rules

- Write for a reader who has never seen the project. Explain *why*, not just *what*.
- Anything durable discovered during work is promoted here from scratch — see
  `[knowledge-promotion workflow path]`.
- `[permanent process knowledge dir]` references these docs; it never duplicates them.
